    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a16e1e8711f6793bb9a26f1e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "王座的背后",
      "source_fingerprint": "460edafca9dde705a1fc45330e73ec0feaff521f58208aa71f9775b9affe5831",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c46955f2daa28a7082b0155e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆与目白赖恩──\n为了得知这两人实力坚强的秘诀，\n优秀素质决定一整天都跟她们一起行动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40a633dbc2eeab664ccc8844e70652ad380dfbf89dde7390df2fffc3d93c84d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abaec075fc9d9bbc211c7935",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "花了一整天跟着两人一起训练，\n最后她了解到，\n她们两人都互相尊重对方、推崇对方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34d73b618f93d6b97a53832794d2895c1935e8afd18ebbe412a8a1e942d84fc7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef27b3cbe8059230b118aa49",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质察觉到\n好好注意四周，并且正视自己\n是相当重要的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdb8b09a0a99f82460940e75b734b9bce62e819b980c9c6ba740fc33d5dc6741",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0505e609253964ffa2c9f56",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即将迈向“宝冢纪念”的她……\n心中“想赢过那两人”的情绪\n变得更加高昂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1d926239302f74567e959b4b26974f1f50f56f2f23f142fe3e2f91c365be8fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87fffb0f0d934ee593334783",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "素质in目白",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e371e7880505755e97cbaf5a33a878c7b9847691b595117dc0ebc10949e1e12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e87cdb0b7a42bf7d4ca7a214",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对东海帝王宣战后，\n优秀素质对着树桩呐喊，\n发泄后悔的情绪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2002e097283778da707d43f216e0a549e5b15c564301abc8ac804b632d6a1e1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0a4c2d09a644d618ea65f80",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质因太过不安而说了丧气话。\n面对这种状态的她，\n训练员表示会打从心底支持她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66b8f23985016ff487e2a7603f256a448a73717f45fedcdcee51f3264ce47f85",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e58cc2e58908562c36f4b5f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员与商店街的大家都在为自己加油，\n察觉到这一点后，她调整了自己的心态，\n决定不再光说丧气话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce846d30dad0b455013af16b88785130ad43fa7f4cf7cd61aeebcd1e24b52035",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e39d0b9ab3b22e5a4ba6dc85",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "闪闪亮亮",
      "source_fingerprint": "13c9ffd4d3b77546bf25efdacb8858e07cf3256e591868e19a9c7c89f6d37f94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89a638bdce24c00c466e1a62",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏天──集训的季节到来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "367ab1588a186f270257b03f8bee9263d2ec1fec46c4cb96262709760cac6832",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a90dee30230a62ad6ecae6fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "明明是该努力提升实力的时期，\n但优秀素质仍像往常一样，\n带着些微自嘲的态度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd592e6b95e28275cff8c7ce0a689dcfe715cd0d09063821b7261c3512fa487f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:566dfb7a1bb6dde9934c313b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我跟这样的她\n就此展开还算热血的夏日时光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed6a7bb4be74ccc6b79fafecda49b01d8249f0d2797a69ebf2ca7d7f2b0837a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b6767b7950ebb9e2ca83818",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第二年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e193ad94ba56712a8e92ed87a15587d1a6af48670f61e354efcb818a0837f0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffb895d31f3a8ee7c2ebaf17",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "又到了集训的季节。\n优秀素质不同于去年，\n展现了积极的态度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "340c2ef3d3ee0361cde973b9be89ddba84308da5789000da310eaa4c9985fae6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc9d19f935a8770402d164ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了迎接“天皇赏（秋）”……\n以及之后即将挑战的“有马纪念”──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b26c6663e7d57e52409b114a474005032953aeb9bc189d4d52960b580d006efd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d8b265213f8be1ecf7eea54",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她开始了正视自己的热血夏天！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa9656354322198663667890f515b22b9b8233d24b10db21b38b23464af58649",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91b370d744fa5e8c5cd07e7b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第三年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef37080660583492caac78b957b8f144bbb2896156162385fc6034f5649e4df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb3d50718283d6dd4ad8c330",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“出道战”正式开场前，\n优秀素质悲观地贬低着自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ea3ca4481853a634f07b090ca119ac1fc89b1a3383982860c54ea475369ec29",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b86be8e71471cfa9cabbe672",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员要她上场发挥实力，\n于是她答应会尽力尝试，\n挤出干劲迈向了出道战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "031085f136cf8c9dc37d89f49e2377ef7722713dfabda8bb4e240e67749f5a4f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a214f2ca9ddb468252340d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea754365577b70c3247fb413fa7b90388e1e4a185a1da5f6c50ef25fe13c496",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d73d3d3dc90cc2cd961c34d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到了“若驹锦标”当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7670f65b0ef258518f543a96f165fad4d32f48135e7aef2880b789b1e57f8ee8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09fdc73ccdf7be7cebbe1f98",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛开始前，东海帝王跑错地方，\n误入优秀素质的休息室，\n并充满自信地做出胜利宣言。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92fee4fe0f0a029d32e886d54cb8f87a7d0743ed8fa8eadfbec87fc331c5f39b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69ad1f980bb91a6a0e7dacac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "眼看东海帝王丝毫不把自己放在眼里，\n优秀素质决定要令她大吃一惊，\n并带着这股决心迈向比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f05bd92ad229908681d2aab9071e7590c5187c0597cc4b586308a148f6fe450",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e17dc5ff175de0abec2716d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向若驹锦标",
      "source_fingerprint": "0436afb017d44535da1620f0451b3f6b3b14f3a8cb765f15b045d9f610930399",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34efcda53d9c9fb3133a66e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“小仓纪念”当天……\n这场竞赛在距离等方面，\n凑齐了对优秀素质有利的各项条件。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7350d7f5182b206f72cbe6009bcafe0fdb334a758b323a02a729c1265db5c13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab41123150078df56c18aec1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但绝佳的条件反而让优秀素质\n感到绝对不能输的压力，令她更加紧绷了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8784b9dc02185d2f71a6826d6cdccb782aa16194b708b41c6e995126819be0d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e2d37bfc9df9f1d83dfab5d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质在紧张的状态下进入亮相圈。\n此时小仓商店街众人的加油声包围了她。",
