      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“中日报杯”比赛当天，\n目白麦昆与目白赖恩前来休息室\n拜访正在等待出场的优秀素质。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c074c95c2228fd42d5bb4ae97f48fa8821c90ee3f7c56645c95652cedac26755",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d96041ba43e6bbe49c3c768a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们表示几天前\n看到优秀素质状况似乎不佳，\n觉得担心而来看看状况。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b56ad6282d934dcd01d3aec34a4d5ecc3f4810d15abab039e9999a0b390691e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c940df896927ff90d7537e6e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质告诉两人\n自己已经顺利地振作起来，\n并随后前往赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3be3873dbc92805512a372df887daa8c5a53dd07a571d24ea09892b50251dcf1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0341563dc21049a542e2275",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向中日报杯",
      "source_fingerprint": "29760cb4cb7e5d29302d30b59d0184a1aa314eb13eedc0bc405c414ff2a88387",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f550733eae43afd63fbc8660",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终于到“有马纪念”……\n古马级最后的大比赛的当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7576168e9d7a2a920ec08e29244872d77a8c690e8057c7e5dbb8ee47d0d42ea1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d6e6299920c1d420dc040cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她已经不是那个胆小的她了。\n为了比谁都更加闪耀──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b54339b4f1edba590a9cec47662074011900e6bc153e9ba5e3ce69bcfcdb9925",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da1b334aff506a2b2184d162",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她踏步迈向“有马纪念”，\n准备迎战东海帝王等诸位强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f787dbf9169285eb71519d2d12d25777a1ed4fc2f0e1e86d68d1b6437d14b407",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28b8ef1cd138a745535bde2b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向有马纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28480a57275928fde3ca335c4e37d5670b04bf8228df0e3cc61294de9b176ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e232ecd043d50100cef7f5ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质顺利地跑完\n“出道战”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa5fad1139ad0e251a706524dbba350cdcaceeaef477992d87cb02eb721d9e4b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a50f5167cef0875c0dace9b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然她相当在意同期中实力特别突出的\n东海帝王的未来动向……\n但仍决定将下一个目标放在“若驹锦标”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68edaf827f04fe73f5238dc9dace8af7d2408c5af424a06939898f599f498a85",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf88d0e79259e7d7de894c8c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・表现安定",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f8bb7b469e4a2639b28ad954aa6750142d22a005251a8f9ba74230b2aeb7d2d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd1f15060e5cf445e70a857f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质在“若驹锦标”\n缔造优于东海帝王的成绩，\n高兴地欢呼出声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9b6eac4667d5810e68412ddd774a5a70637a0c2a8499ac0c026bd6bd9dfc1ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bf3b1850934c150c85ee55d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但看到虽然落败却仍旧积极的东海帝王后，\n她又立刻冷静了下来──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae30a982d969b9c04859d8a392904d9b42a812b7cd4cf73f3d1f8c181cff2a26",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf19dc5406a6b28b5e46b024",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她下了结论，\n认为这次的结果只是“偶然”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1da59cfdf84e385c2727ae4a6c0530e77626b285049ceaac62097ebf29928563",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2c27496a4fe5b282153bdb4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了建立她的自信，\n训练员提议去远征，\n推荐她参加“小仓纪念”这场在地竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "477cbfe541b2a3076f89cfa643971b167ad1defcd89d0f3ba4ce8984d2d77876",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69e2972e49bc3e3d0aaa747f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若驹锦标结束后・从“偶然”开始",
      "source_fingerprint": "d05677e0668127c2b5c9b5091e394e18c27aa9e5e8451691ac9716a885327f0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0a02b1a3deeb4c609c9712d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质以不错的成绩\n顺利地跑完“若驹锦标”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86f35f7d62aa9cf0fe6488132c9701158a86d712bd1bf203aa976d2ce08b5056",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67af4a5e3ee4119b104bfd6a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但看到以闪耀的奔跑方式\n掳获人心的东海帝王之后，\n她失去了干劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87c1d12849cfccf09ecb9b26db6715d661939a53ee0d83051fac88ef4a13283f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f3e575c92bebbd21ed5d961",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了建立她的自信，\n训练员提议去远征，\n推荐她参加“小仓纪念”这场在地竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "477cbfe541b2a3076f89cfa643971b167ad1defcd89d0f3ba4ce8984d2d77876",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b71007eb3f96f11a6d6b13b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若驹锦标结束后・输了夏天仍会到来",
      "source_fingerprint": "a164717dc796c203b00e3e8d4a2823dde7f7e2979a99ced8ee7dbfb3449a4b16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b81b18a8754fb630eb82432",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“皋月赏”结束了。\n优秀素质比东海帝王还要早抵达终点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c4cdd3b7067f08fd86c025ce93728b1335da8977e5f5068ae2b9383c3d687b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8dc10240979ee11c7ec9529",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但优秀素质仍然很羡慕\n“闪闪发光”的东海帝王。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2136ffd974aee7c76b69867ed8778983236dbdc078aefd90483bab046c791789",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060420.json",
      "json_path": [
